					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13903961</guid>
				<title>SCP-5751</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13903961/scp-5751</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 11 Dec 2020 01:07:40 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>HarryBlank</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6479803</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>One of the longest gestation periods I've had for a skip. This one was in my head before ETTRA was a thing, before Dr. Dan lived again. Luckily, I think those things provided a focus the idea needed.</p> <p>This is pretty obviously a spiritual successor, or maybe even a direct sequel, to <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5109">SCP-5109</a>: &quot;The One-Time Password.&quot; It still stands alone, though.</p> <p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607648870" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607648870" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span> for their crit!</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Image&nbsp;credits</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close&nbsp;image&nbsp;credits</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>5.jpg is borrowed from:</p> <p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a href="https://ccsearch-dev.creativecommons.org/photos/c0e3242a-3b58-419b-a03e-f275eb105f93">flickr</a><br /> <strong>Creator</strong>: Kino Praxis<br /> <strong>License</strong>: CC BY 2.0</p> <hr /> <p>HDD.jpg is borrowed from:</p> <p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a href="https://ccsearch-dev.creativecommons.org/photos/5fd38fcf-d07a-43ce-a6e3-8a7b046ebb1b">flickr</a><br /> <strong>Creator</strong>: Ervins Strauhmanis<br /> <strong>License</strong>: CC BY 2.0</p> <hr /> <p>Laser.jpg is borrowed from:</p> <p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:LDDVDComparison-mod.png">Wikimedia Commons</a><br /> <strong>Creator</strong>: Kevin586<br /> <strong>License</strong>: CC BY-SA 3.0</p> <p>All other images were created by the author and are freely released under CC 3.0. Identifying trademarks have been removed and/or replaced in all cases.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13903926</guid>
				<title>PEAK</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13903926/peak</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 11 Dec 2020 00:17:57 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Elogee FishTruck</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4037075</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Spurred on by a free-write in my English class today. Thought about poetic forms, which became thinking about Oulipo and the snowball poetry method, which led to thinking about making it a mountain instead of just a hill. This meshed, in tandem, with SCP-5140 and that recent news about Mt. Everest growing two feet. Spooky.</p> <p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187885&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607652525" alt="Rounderhouse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187885)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" >Rounderhouse</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607652525" alt="Yossipossi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" >Yossipossi</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3337265&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607652525" alt="Tufto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3337265)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" >Tufto</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1613974&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607652525" alt="UraniumEmpire" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1613974)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" >UraniumEmpire</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alces-alces" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4057128&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607652525" alt="Alces_alces" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4057128)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alces-alces" >Alces_alces</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607652525" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span> for feedback.</p> <p>Also thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607652525" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607652525" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span> for providing the CSS! The background is yoinked from the Xmas theme, and the background from the WoAF theme.</p> <p>Images sourced in Licensebox.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
