				<wikidot:authorName>Krombopulos_Will</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6673645</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>They speak of children when talking about prisoners and prisoners when talking about children. She made the most common mistake, underestimating an authority figure's capacity for evil.</p> <p>Special thanks to my friends Mila and Silver, who went through a million drafts.</p> <p>Thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/weizhong" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1777811&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607530452" alt="weizhong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1777811)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/weizhong" >weizhong</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607530452" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chaucer345" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2002514&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607530452" alt="chaucer345" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2002514)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chaucer345" >chaucer345</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/space-kaiser" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5821360&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607530452" alt="Space_Kaiser" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5821360)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/space-kaiser" >Space_Kaiser</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mikaelious" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5993393&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607530452" alt="Mikaelious" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5993393)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mikaelious" >Mikaelious</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2000367&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607530452" alt="WrongJohnSilver" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2000367)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" >WrongJohnSilver</a></span>. Sorry if I missed anybody!</p> <p>Snail people are from <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/uiu-file-1948-019">http://www.scpwiki.com/uiu-file-1948-019</a> — Sackett doesn’t act quite like the description but I figure they would change with age.</p> 
